# Vite copies web/index.html into src/delta_review/static verbatim, so a CRLF
# checkout on Windows produces a CRLF file in the packaged assets and every
# refresh shows up as a whole-file diff. Pin the source to LF so the generated
# copy is already LF and nobody has to remember to convert it by hand.
web/index.html text eol=lf
